    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20b634bbfd1ab824e77d01c3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然来帮忙加油的北部玄驹\n建议她“当场献唱一曲”，\n但小林历奇还是婉拒了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "73445069013a959c9e01b43f23906fdd59020168c4016c4954246eca6057b3b4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
