    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6bf88ca9f0672c489d5a6f8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "下一个目标是“帝王赏”。如果北港火山\n顺利恢复状态，一定会参加这场比赛，\n小林历奇期待能在这场比赛与她再次对决。",
      "source_fingerprint": "75af95883fbc012ef5e678fc5a44342e7d93d5b75c41930a253668de289ff67d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
