    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ad229fbe88accf9e66093c9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小林历奇和北港火山上演了一场火热对决。\n现场自然地响起了宛如暴风般的热烈掌声，\n以及祝贺北港火山回归的温暖掌声。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c60ca380a1b719a1a96339383fa1e5c395a1dacc5c76939f462ac243665fceb7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1098/storytimeline_501098432.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
