      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "之后两人开始讨论起下一场比赛的事情。\n因为想尽快一起奔驰，\n两人激动地要训练员快点决定。",
      "source_fingerprint": "268b5530d6c164bbfb121c5fc0f77d58347a0e621c61d7159d8dcf666605542e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
