      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "此时，奇锐骏也表示希望下次能一起参赛。\n于是三人的下一个目标，\n就决定是一起参加“JBC经典赛”了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f26744d48ce71af0c67ac5ba7d21fdac832210a5028454a28f097555eed377e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1098/storytimeline_501098432.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
