    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c323d24ebcd0bb2237b0e931",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "三人势均力敌，各自发挥出所有实力。\n然而，小林历奇在比赛结束后，\n开始望向更高的境界。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7a8ff414a9bf14cc7c8b0d77edd8f3192a58e8e4dba0aff02ff15d44e54e87f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1098/storytimeline_501098433.json",
      "json_path": [
