      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "几天后，小林历奇诉说新萌生的梦想。\n她不再追求势均力敌的“四神相应”，\n而是想要站上她们的顶点──",
      "source_fingerprint": "796bc3ffff0a7f145e9143df93e69df1118c364560124f2d0888ae2d16c4851e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1098/storytimeline_501098433.json",
      "json_path": [
