      "uid": "zhcn:b3b83b8dfac1d4a8641575f7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她想成为统率“四神”、君临顶点的“黄龙”。\n怀着崭新的决心，目标是要在接下来的\n“东京大赏典”中成为王者。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e7ae3fbf10f3aba47b601f7db729ee77cd0f8dddab4e6563befa6b13bdbf6c9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
