      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "替大家带来幸福──小林历奇心怀这个横跨\n风水三千年历史的愿望，强劲地奔驰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "31cb7b1e0949b042febe19e308be94765752a81313f4bce080689bdf0175423b",
