    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e3c79825731918a90c9fec2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小林历奇成为了王者。见证这一刻的所有人，\n都开始坚信只要整顿好环境再进行挑战，\n上天一定会对自己微笑……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1370dedc35cb135a80de0b15d56a3232a90f754d91dfc2f93268876c18900984",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1098/storytimeline_501098434.json",
