      "source_text": "然而，北港火山并不打算让小林历奇\n一人独大。她表示会再次挑战迪拜，\n迈向更高的境界。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e7a8be92eb04f0e5c56cad69e3b4eef58603f8a41068660c31039abbbac5a26",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
